      "message": "At the moment, nothing. But in a future CL, I will plug this into the Rust GATT implementation, so you can do:\n```\nlet conn \u003d timeout(TIMEOUT, self.direct_connection.await?).await?; \nlet gatt \u003d Gatt(conn);\ngatt.read/write/etc().await\n```\nall in a single sequence.",
